Hello fellow NetHackers,

At the Finnish science fiction convention FinnCon 2007 there will be a
presentation about NetHack and its monsters. Location is University of
Jyv=E4skyl=E4, Main building, Lecture hall C5 and the title of the
presentation is "Pelottava h-kirjain ja NetHackin muut omituiset
otukset" (=3D "Frightening letter h and other strange creatures of
NetHack").

The presentation will be on Sunday 15th July at 16:00-17:00.

I am planning to tell about NetHack itself and its references to scifi
and fantasy and especially about its monsters. I would be happy to be
accompanied by some other people, so you can contact me at
mikko@tuomela.net if you are interested in taking part.

We also have a possibility (reserved place) for a NetHack meeting at
Kirjailijatalo at 11:00 - 13:00 on Saturday!

You can also drop me a note about ideas and suggestions about this
event. You can also find me on IRC, on #nethack (IRCnet).

